      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/ecuador/100-sucres-1993/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Ecuador — One Hundred Sucres, Low Seriess Pair\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/ecuador/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Ecuador catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Central Bank of Ecuador &middot; Series WF &middot; August 20, 1993</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">One Hundred Sucres, Low Series Pair</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Two consecutive issues, N.&deg; 00000002 and 00000003 &mdash; among the first banknotes printed in the entire issue</p>\n        </div>\n<div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n<button data-zoom-trigger=\"serial-2\"\n                aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote: Banknote of Cien Sucres del Central Bank of Ecuador, serie WF, número de serie 00000002, obverse con portrait of Simón Bolívar y reverse con el escudo nacional\"\n                style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/ecuador-banco-central-100-sucres-1993-serial-00000002.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"/uploads/ecuador-banco-central-100-sucres-1993-serial-00000002.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of Cien Sucres del Central Bank of Ecuador, serie WF, número de serie 00000002, obverse con portrait of Simón Bolívar y reverse con el escudo nacional\"\n                    width=\"564\"\n                    loading=\"lazy\"\n                    decoding=\"async\"\n                    style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n                <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:14px; right:14px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:999px;\">\n                  <span style=\"width:5px; height:5px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n              </button>\n</div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:900px; margin:0 auto 24px;\">\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.7; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">This pair of Cien Sucres, identical in date and series, bears consecutive numbers almost at the very beginning of the print run &mdash;00000002 and 00000003&mdash;, immediately after specimen N.&deg; 1. For collectors, consecutive pairs with such low numbers are considerably more coveted than an individual banknote: they provide tangible evidence of the start of an issue.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:900px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr)); gap:32px; margin:40px 0 8px;\">\n\n          \n            <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;\">\n              \n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:130px 1fr; gap:4px 16px; padding:12px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">N.&deg; Series</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#221f19;\">00000002</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Series</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#221f19;\">WF</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#221f19;\">Quito, August 20, 1993</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Reference</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#221f19;\">Pick P-123Ab</span>\n              </div>\n\n              \n            </div>\n          \n\n            <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;\">\n              <button data-zoom-trigger=\"serial-3\"\n                aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote: Banknote of Cien Sucres del Central Bank of Ecuador, serie WF, número de serie 00000003, obverse con portrait of Simón Bolívar y reverse con el escudo nacional\"\n                style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/ecuador-banco-central-100-sucres-1993-serial-00000003.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"/uploads/ecuador-banco-central-100-sucres-1993-serial-00000003.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of Cien Sucres del Central Bank of Ecuador, serie WF, número de serie 00000003, obverse con portrait of Simón Bolívar y reverse con el escudo nacional\"\n                    width=\"564\"\n                    loading=\"lazy\"\n                    decoding=\"async\"\n                    style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n                <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:14px; right:14px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:999px;\">\n                  <span style=\"width:5px; height:5px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n              </button>\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:130px 1fr; gap:4px 16px; padding:12px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">N.&deg; Series</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#221f19;\">00000003</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Series</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#221f19;\">WF</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#221f19;\">Quito, August 20, 1993</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Reference</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:17px; color:#221f19;\">Pick P-123Ab</span>\n              </div>\n\n              \n            </div>\n          \n\n        </div>\n\n        \n          <div data-zoom-dialog=\"serial-2\" hidden role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Banknote ampliado: Banknote of Cien Sucres del Central Bank of Ecuador, serie WF, número de serie 00000002, obverse con portrait of Simón Bolívar y reverse con el escudo nacional\" class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n            <button\n              data-zoom-close\n              aria-label=\"Close\"\n              style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n            >&times;</button>\n\n            <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n              <button\n                disabled=\"true\"\n                data-zoom-out aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&minus;</button>\n              <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\" data-zoom-percent>100%</span>\n              <button\n                disabled=\"false\"\n                data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&#43;</button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div\n              style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\"\n            >\n              <picture>\n                <source srcset=\"/uploads/ecuador-banco-central-100-sucres-1993-serial-00000002.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                <img data-zoom-image\n                  src=\"/uploads/ecuador-banco-central-100-sucres-1993-serial-00000002.jpg\"\n                  alt=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n                  draggable=\"false\"\n                  style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                />\n              </picture>\n            </div>\n\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n          </div>\n        \n\n          <div data-zoom-dialog=\"serial-3\" hidden role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Banknote ampliado: Banknote of Cien Sucres del Central Bank of Ecuador, serie WF, número de serie 00000003, obverse con portrait of Simón Bolívar y reverse con el escudo nacional\" class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n            <button\n              data-zoom-close\n              aria-label=\"Close\"\n              style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n            >&times;</button>\n\n            <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n              <button\n                disabled=\"true\"\n                data-zoom-out aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&minus;</button>\n              <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\" data-zoom-percent>100%</span>\n              <button\n                disabled=\"false\"\n                data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&#43;</button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div\n              style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\"\n            >\n              <picture>\n                <source srcset=\"/uploads/ecuador-banco-central-100-sucres-1993-serial-00000003.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                <img data-zoom-image\n                  src=\"/uploads/ecuador-banco-central-100-sucres-1993-serial-00000003.jpg\"\n                  alt=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n                  draggable=\"false\"\n                  style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                />\n              </picture>\n            </div>\n\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n          </div>\n        \n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:900px; margin-top:16px;\">\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Obverse and Reverse</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>oval portrait of Simón Bolívar in military uniform at center, with large &ldquo;100&rdquo; counters in all four corners within ornamental frames, the inscription &ldquo;BANCO CENTRAL DEL ECUADOR&rdquo;, the place of issue &ldquo;Quito&rdquo;, the date, the signatures of the General Manager and Deputy General Manager, and the serial number repeated in blue ink in both upper corners.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>national coat of arms of Ecuador in the center &mdash;Andean condor, sun and landscape of the Chimborazo volcano with the Guayas steamship&mdash;, flanked by large figures &ldquo;100&rdquo; and the legend &ldquo;CIEN SUCRES&rdquo;, printed in violet hue with symmetrical guilloches.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">The Ecuadorian Sucre</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">The sucre, named after the independence hero Antonio José de Sucre, was the currency of Ecuador between 1884 and 2000, when the severe financial crisis of the late 1990s led to its replacement by the US dollar. This 1993 Hundred Sucres bill belongs to the last years of the national currency, shortly before the accelerated inflation at the end of the century led to the official dollarization of the Ecuadorian economy in the year 2000.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Legacy for Collectors</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Pairs of banknotes with consecutive and extremely low numbering &mdash;like this N.&deg; 00000002 and 00000003&mdash; are pieces in high demand within thematic collecting, as they document the very beginning of a printing run, something that rarely survives intact and in pairs to this day.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); padding-top:24px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n              <li>Pick, Albert.<em>Standard Catalog of World Paper Money.</em></li>\n              <li>Numista —<a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n              <li>Heritage Auctions —<a href=\"https://www.ha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">ha.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n              <li>Central Bank of Ecuador —<a href=\"https://www.bce.fin.ec\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">bce.fin.ec<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <aside aria-labelledby=\"related-reading-heading\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:900px; margin:48px auto 0; padding-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n      <h2 id=\"related-reading-heading\" style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 16px; font-style:normal;\">Keep exploring</h2>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr)); gap:14px;\">\n        <a href=\"/blog/numeros-serie-especiales-billetes/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Special serial numbers on banknotes</a>\n        <a href=\"/noticias/billete-2-dolares-serie-baja/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">A low-serial-number two-dollar bill</a>\n        <a href=\"/en/collection/ecuador/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Ecuador Collection</a>\n        <a href=\"/glosario/#numeracion-especial\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Glossary: special numbering</a>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
